  <ul>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Where do you see the search term being used?</li>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">Which part of the code decides whether a page is included in the results?</li>
    <li style="font-size: 14pt;">If a user searched for a different word, what is the one place you would change?</li>
  </ul>

  <div style="clear:both;"></div>
</div>



<img src="https://images.code.org/27526a2ffecd3d3b9ca19967d1489a5e-image-1767803724551.png" alt="JavaScript code sample with a searching function for a calendar" width="650px" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;border-radius:10px; ">

---

## Breaking it down



#### **1. The data (array of objects)** 

<img src="https://images.code.org/140a16e283fdb9d39f28457606140f8f-image-1767803913974.png" alt="array of songs in javascript" width="450px" style="border-radius:10px; float:right; margin: 0 0 40px 20px;">

#### This is the data the app starts with. 
#### Each page is an object, and all the pages together are stored in an array. 

<br><br>


#### **2. The search logic (inside a function)**

<div style="clear:both;"></div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/b888879a13a1a1f5bfce1f20f47dc052-image-1767804325162.png" alt="function with search algorithm" width="450px" style="border-radius:10px; float:right; margin: 0 0 40px 20px;">


#### This function defines the search rule.
#### It looks at each page and checks whether the title includes the search term (like “calendar”).

> #### `toLowerCase()` is a JavaScript string function that converts all letters in text to lowercase.
> #### It’s commonly used in searching so that matches work regardless of capitalization.

<br><br>


#### **3. Using the function**

<img src="https://images.code.org/11e47568ea70e49b94ebda716af3df8d-image-1767804025432.png" alt="calling the function in javascript" width="450px" style="border-radius:10px; float:right; margin: 0 0 40px 20px;">

#### This line runs the function using the original data.
#### The result is a new array that contains only the pages that match the search term.

